# Core 0.4, Stage A0.3 (LABS-1.002): functional-slot declarations, stored as data in TypeDB (U-4: implementation
# choice consistent with "TypeDB is the only store"; profile packaging is Stage D).
#
# A declaration says: for content of this proposition type (and its subtypes, unless one declares its own: U-5),
# at most one value of `value-role` holds at a time for each combination of the `slot-role` players. located-at has
# slot (located) and value place; a seat assignment might have slot (venue, seat) and value occupant.
# Role names are core role names (a specialised role is named by the core role it specialises).

define
attribute slot-predicate, value string;
attribute slot-role, value string;
attribute value-role, value string;
entity functional-slot, owns slot-predicate @key, owns slot-role @card(1..), owns value-role @card(1..1);
